comment:
Great calm place with a good vibe overlooking the pool and tons of healthy options.
Medium to high prices.
Good range of vegan and vegetarian options on the menu.
We tried:
Salad: "Roasted Carrot Avocado" (Some kind of spice crunches unpleasantly on the teeth);
Bowl: "Panang Red Curry" (delicious 👍);
"Vegan burger" (it is disappointing, as a little dry);
"Baked Falafel" (delicious 👍);
Desserts: "Tart Slice of Heaven", "Blue Matcha Pudding" and "Coconut Rice Pudding" (delicious 👍);
Juices: "Beetle Juice" and "Cleanse Intense "(delicious and healthy 👍);
I'll definitely go back again.
Definitely recommend!
